  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 102.50 Cover material",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 102.50 “Cover material” means soil or other functionally equivalent material that is placed over solid waste at a landfill. The term does not include materials used to construct a landfill capping system.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; renumbered by #13357 (formerly Env-Sw 102.45); ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 102.43) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
